OL,3,GNEWSAPub bombings campaigners march for
OL,4,Apublic inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of those killed in the
OL,7,FBirmingham pub bombings have marched
OL,8,Fthrough the city centre to renew calls
OL,9,Ffor a public inquiry, nearly 52 years
OL,10,Fafter the attacks.
OL,12,F21 people were killed and more than 200
OL,13,Fwere injured when bombs gutted The
OL,14,FMulberry Bush and The Tavern in the
OL,15,FTown on 21 November 1974.
OL,17,FAn inquest in 2019 concluded the
OL,18,Fvictims had been unlawfully killed by
OL,19,Fthe IRA, but did not establish the
OL,20,Fidentities of those responsible.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
